You partially remove yourself from the timeline for 10 turns.

This increases your resistance to all damage by [28%, 38%, 46%, 52%, 58% (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)], reduces the duration of all detrimental effects on you by [30%, 36%, 40%, 43%, 45% (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)], and reduces all damage you deal by 20%.

The resistance bonus, effect reduction, and damage penalty will gradually lose power over the duration of the spell.

The effects scale with your Spellpower.
